# Ceti Eel: "When this creature enters, mill two cards, then put a +1/+1 counter on this creature for each artifact and/or
# creature card in your graveyard" (CR 701.17a, 608.2c, 122.1). Cast on turn 1, it mills exactly two - the Ornithopter
# (an artifact creature, one card, so one counter, not two) and the Llanowar Elves (a creature) - and only then counts, so
# both are counted: two counters and a 4/4. Counting before the mill would leave it a 2/2.

